{"about_the_game":"<strong>Wanted Wizard 2</strong> is a top-down 2D action RPG.<br>Travel around the country with the cheeky black cat, fight powerful enemies with the power of magic, and uncover the mysteries of the Isol Kingdom!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff0aFeatures\uff0a</strong></h2><br>\u30fbExtremely simplified operability and game system!<br>\u30fbEasy difficulty level for beginners!<br>\u30fbCombat with unique bosses!<br>\u30fbGraphics with a good atmosphere!<br>\u30fbMusic that inspires adventure!<br>\u30fbA thrilling and harrowing story!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff0aStory\uff0a</strong></h2><br>The Protagonist Is An Ordinary Young Man.<br>Together with her kind-hearted younger sister, they lived an ordinary but pleasant daily life.<br>Until his sister was chosen as a sacrifice by the kingdom...<br><br>The protagonist, deprived of his only beloved family member, seeks power from evil magic sealed away.<br>Will the protagonist be able to overcome the powerful enemies that stand in his way and rescue his sister?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff0aOperation\uff0a</strong></h2><br>There are only 3 major operations!<br><br>1. Move<br>Move the player.<br>Run around in all directions!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491250/extras/81ea0ceec2d811438abee22c29793d90.poster.avif?t=1754281332\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491250/extras/81ea0ceec2d811438abee22c29793d90.webm?t=1754281332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491250/extras/81ea0ceec2d811438abee22c29793d90.mp4?t=1754281332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>2. Attack<br>Attack with the power of magic.<br>Defeat all enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli